"##product_table##\n"
"Позиции: ##number_of_items##\n"
"Итого: ##order_total##\n"
"\n"
"Доставлено:\n"
"##shipping_first_name## ##shipping_last_name##\n"
"##shipping_address##\n"
"\n"
